 "remarks": "Stress-Free, Short-Term, furnished rental (Available from January 1, 2027 thru end of May 2027) in the Heart of New Canaan...  Perfect for discerning renters navigating life transitions-whether you're renovating your dream home, waiting for your new home closing, or simply need temporary housing in New Canaan.  Why Choose This Exceptional Rental... Prime In-Town Location: Walk to shops, restaurants, and town amenities. Fully Furnished & Move-In Ready: No need to worry about furniture or household essentials. Spacious 3-Bedroom Layout: Comfortable accommodations for families or professionals. Private Outdoor Retreat: Enjoy your own patio and fully fenced backyard-perfect for relaxation, entertaining, or pets Turnkey Convenience: Focus on your renovation or home search while living comfortably.  Live Without Compromise - Why settle for cramped temporary quarters or the stress of unfurnished rentals? This beautifully appointed home offers all the comforts and privacy you need during your transition, allowing you to maintain your lifestyle while your plans unfold.  Available for short-term lease. Schedule your private showing and discover stress-free living in New Canaan's most desirable in-town setting.",
